('5268','2106','pjBaseField','2','title','This is the iCal link for this property. Copy it and add it on <strong>Airbnb, Booking.com, Vrbo, Google Calendar</strong> and any other channel you use. Those platforms will read this link and <strong>block the dates that are already booked in this system</strong>, so you never get a double booking. This link is read-only &ndash; just copy it.','script'),
('5269','2107','pjBaseField','2','title','Import bookings from other platforms','script'),
('5270','2108','pjBaseField','2','title','Paste the iCal export links from the platforms where this property is also listed (<strong>Airbnb, Booking.com, Vrbo, Google Calendar</strong>&hellip;). This system will read those calendars and <strong>create matching bookings here</strong>, so any dates booked elsewhere are automatically blocked in your calendar. Add <strong>one link per row</strong> using the plus (+) button. Imported bookings are kept up to date automatically each time the sync runs.','script');
