('13405','11','pjPayment','2','cash','Cash','data'),
('13406','11','pjCalendar','2','name','QA Cedar Cottage','data'),
('13407','11','pjCalendar','2','address_1','12 Mall Road','data'),
('13408','11','pjCalendar','2','address_city','Manali','data'),
('13409','11','pjCalendar','2','description','<p>Set in the tranquil landscapes of Manali, Himachal Pradesh, QA Cedar Cottage offers an elegant retreat managed by QA Hill Stays. Designed with an emphasis on understated comfort, this private residence provides a peaceful sanctuary amidst the natural beauty of northern India.</p><p>The cottage features two thoughtfully appointed bedrooms and two bathrooms, creating an intimate space ideal for small families or couples seeking a quiet getaway. Every corner reflects a modern, boutique aesthetic that seamlessly complements the surrounding mountain environment.</p><p>Whether relaxing indoors or exploring the charm of Manali, guests enjoy a seamless stay tailored to high standards of hospitality.</p>','data'),
('13410','11','pjCalendar','2','headline','Cedar views, quiet mornings in Manali','data'),
('13411','11','pjCalendar','2','faqs','[{\"question\":\"How many bedrooms and bathrooms does the cottage offer?\",\"answer\":\"The property includes two bedrooms and two bathrooms.\"},{\"question\":\"Who manages the property?\",\"answer\":\"QA Cedar Cottage is professionally managed by QA Hill Stays.\"},{\"question\":\"What time is check-in and check-out?\",\"answer\":\"For specific check-in and check-out times, guests can ask the host before booking.\"},{\"question\":\"Is parking available at the property?\",\"answer\":\"For details regarding parking and other amenities, guests can ask the host before booking.\"},{\"question\":\"Is there parking?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, free parking for one car.\"}]','data'),
('13412','11','pjCalendar','2','content_tone','premium','data'),
