('13708','12','pjCalendar','2','description','<p>Welcome to Kapoor Niwas, a refined holiday home located in Kurali, Punjab, India. Designed to offer a peaceful and intimate sanctuary, this residence provides a sophisticated setting for travelers seeking comfort and privacy.</p><p>The property features two thoughtfully appointed bedrooms and two bathrooms, providing ideal accommodations for a relaxing stay. Every room offers a balance of functional convenience and understated elegance, ensuring a seamless experience from arrival to departure.</p><p>Managed by a new hospitality company, Kapoor Niwas is committed to delivering attentive service and a high standard of care. Whether you are visiting Kurali for business or leisure, this private home offers a welcoming retreat in the heart of Punjab.</p>','data'),
('13709','12','pjCalendar','2','headline','Kapoor Niwas Elegant Two Bedroom Sanctuary in Kurali','data'),
('13710','12','pjCalendar','2','faqs','[{\"question\":\"How many bedrooms and bathrooms does Kapoor Niwas offer?\",\"answer\":\"The property includes two bedrooms and two bathrooms.\"},{\"question\":\"Where is Kapoor Niwas located?\",\"answer\":\"Kapoor Niwas is situated in Kurali, Punjab, India.\"},{\"question\":\"Is parking available at the property?\",\"answer\":\"Specific parking details are not provided, so guests can ask the host before booking.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the check-in and check-out times?\",\"answer\":\"Check-in and check-out schedules are not specified, so guests can ask the host before booking.\"}]','data'),
