('14411','14','pjCalendar','2','description','<p>Love Nest BnB is a cozy and romantic getaway crafted especially for couples seeking comfort, privacy, and unforgettable moments together. With warm lighting, elegant interiors, and love-inspired decor, it sets the perfect mood for relaxation and connection. Whether you’re celebrating love or simply escaping the routine, every corner is designed to bring you closer and create beautiful memories filled with warmth, charm, and affection.</p>','data'),
('14412','14','pjCalendar','2','headline','Welcome to The Love Nest in Zirakpur','data'),
('14413','14','pjCalendar','2','faqs','[{\"question\":\"How do I check in to the apartment?\",\"answer\":\"We offer convenient self check-in using a lockbox so you can arrive smoothly.\"},{\"question\":\"Is parking available on site?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, free parking is available for your vehicle during your stay.\"},{\"question\":\"Are pets allowed at the property?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, pets are warmly welcomed in our one-bedroom studio.\"},{\"question\":\"What is nearby in the local area?\",\"answer\":\"For details on local attractions and nearby places in Zirakpur, please feel free to ask us before booking.\"}]','data'),
