('14978','21','pjCalendar','2','description','<p>Little Country Houses - Finley&#039;s Fort + hot tub is a 1-bedroom and 1-bathroom cottage located in phpjabbbers, phpjabbbers, India. The host is Little Country Houses - Finley&#039;s Fort + hot tub.</p><p>Inside, the property includes a kitchen equipped with a microwave, fridge, freezer, oven, kettle, toaster, cooking basics, and crockery and cutlery. The cottage features heating, an indoor fireplace, a TV, hot water, bed linen, hangers, a hairdryer, and cleaning products. Safety items include a smoke alarm, fire extinguisher, and first aid kit.</p><p>Outside, guests have access to a patio or balcony, outdoor furniture, a firepit, a BBQ grill, a hot tub, and free parking.</p>','data'),
('14979','21','pjCalendar','2','headline','Cottage in India with Hot Tub and Fireplace','data'),
('14980','21','pjCalendar','2','faqs','[{\"question\":\"Is free parking available at the cottage?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, free parking is available on the property. test\"},{\"question\":\"How many bedrooms and bathrooms does the property have?\",\"answer\":\"The property has 1 bedroom and 1 bathroom.\"},{\"question\":\"What kitchen amenities are provided?\",\"answer\":\"The kitchen includes a microwave, fridge, freezer, oven, kettle, toaster, cooking basics, and crockery and cutlery.\"},{\"question\":\"What time is check-in and check-out?\",\"answer\":\"Guests can ask the host about check-in times before booking.\"}]','data'),
