('15115','22','pjCalendar','2','description','<p>Welcome to our lovely one bedroom villa in Boston, MA, India. We are excited to open our doors to you and offer a comfortable, relaxing stay. Whether you are visiting for work or leisure, our home provides a warm and inviting space where you can feel right at home from the moment you arrive.</p><p>Inside, you will find a dedicated workspace that makes it easy to stay productive during your trip. The property also features a clean, private bathroom and free parking on the premises, so you can travel with complete peace of mind.</p><p>As your host, twat+2, I am always happy to help make your stay as smooth as possible. If you have any questions or need anything at all before or during your stay, please feel free to reach out.</p>','data'),
('15116','22','pjCalendar','2','headline','Cozy One Bedroom Villa in Boston India','data'),
('15117','22','pjCalendar','2','faqs','[{\"question\":\"What type of property is this and how many guests can stay?\",\"answer\":\"This property is a one bedroom villa with one bathroom. For details on maximum guest capacity, please ask the host before booking.\"},{\"question\":\"Is parking available on site?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, we offer free parking for our guests on the property.\"},{\"question\":\"Is there a space to work remotely?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, the villa includes a dedicated workspace for your convenience.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the check-in and check-out times?\",\"answer\":\"Please ask the host before booking to confirm the exact check-in and check-out times.\"}]','data'),
