('16527','29','pjCalendar','2','description','<p>test+4 property is a holiday rental apartment located in phpjabbbers, phpjabbbers, India. The property owner and host is test+4. This rental apartment is set up to host a maximum of 4 guests at a time.</p><p>The space contains 2 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms. With 2 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms, the property has enough beds and facilities for 4 people. The apartment is situated in the area of phpjabbbers, phpjabbbers, India.</p><p>test+4 property offers accommodation for up to 4 guests under the hosting of test+4. The apartment features 2 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms in total. You can view availability and details for test+4 property directly on this website for your trip to phpjabbbers, India.</p>','data'),
('16528','29','pjCalendar','2','headline','WElcome to test+4 property','data'),
('16529','29','pjCalendar','2','faqs','[{\"question\":\"How many bedrooms and bathrooms does test+4 property offer?\",\"answer\":\"The apartment features two bedrooms and two bathrooms.\"},{\"question\":\"How many guests can stay at the property?\",\"answer\":\"test+4 property accommodates a maximum of four guests.\"},{\"question\":\"Is parking available at the property?\",\"answer\":\"Parking is not listed for this residence. Guests are welcome to contact the host, test+4, prior to booking.\"},{\"question\":\"Are pets permitted during the stay?\",\"answer\":\"Pet policies are not listed for this property. Please inquire with the host before confirming your reservation.\"}]','data'),
